WEBVTT

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:31.100
(Duartrokitje)

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:34.519
HP: OK. Atehere, ky biznesi i imitimeve

00:07:34.519 --> 00:07:36.204
i paska rreziqet e veta.

00:07:36.204 --> 00:07:38.912
Nuk shkon gjithmone sipas planit,

00:07:38.912 --> 00:07:42.382
edhe me nje perkthyes te talentuar.

00:07:42.382 --> 00:07:44.668
Por do ti qendroj kesaj,

00:07:44.668 --> 00:07:49.033
sepse ne kundershtim me ate qe mund te hamendesojme,

00:07:49.033 --> 00:07:53.132
te imituarit e dikujt mund te nxjerre ne pah dicka unike.

00:07:53.132 --> 00:07:56.387
Pra, sa here deshtoja

00:07:56.387 --> 00:07:58.943
te isha si babai im,

00:07:58.943 --> 00:08:02.838
behesha me shume vetvetja.